WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.039
A still winter night. The sun has gone.

2
00:00:04.109 --> 00:00:07.473
<v Dev>Dev: The winter test! Look. Every light has gone out.

3
00:00:07.543 --> 00:00:09.951
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. But I was 90% sure!

4
00:00:10.021 --> 00:00:13.394
<v Posy>Posy: Enough power for a still winter night. Store the sunshine.

5
00:00:13.464 --> 00:00:19.956
<v Florence>Florence: A wind turbine and batteries. I have not planned for winter before. Only 74% sure.

6
00:00:20.026 --> 00:00:22.753
<v Dev>Dev: Test it again. The lights stay on!

7
00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:26.494
Plan your power for the hardest night, and store some for later.

8
00:00:26.564 --> 00:00:29.935
And sure is not the same as right. So test the plan.
